  "solution": "$T = 1000$ K and $A = 2 \\times 10^{-4}\\ \\text{m}^2$:\n$$P = \\sigma AT^4 = 5.67 \\times 10^{-8} \\times 2 \\times 10^{-4} \\times 10^{12} = 11.34\\ \\text{W}$$",
